<title>USA: One Valley Bancorp to begin NYSE trading May 22.</title>
<headline>One Valley Bancorp to begin NYSE trading May 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Valley Bancorp Inc, a bank holding company based in Charleston, W.Va., announced Monday it will begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on May 22.</p>
<p>It said it will be traded under the symbol &quot;OV.&quot;</p>
<p>One Valley has total assets of $4.4 billion and has 12 affiliate banks with 89 offices, of which 79 are in West Virginia and 10 in Virginia, it said.</p>
